Gutenberg block written with ESNext standard and JSX support – build step required.

== Description ==

This plugin installs a gutenberg block that allows you to customize images with real time animations & compositions. It is better to show then tell, so we put together a short video to give you all the juicy details.

https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4sfdJ-fIhnM

== Screenshots ==

1. Build animated image compositions.
2. Built in text engine using raster graphics.

== Installation ==

This section describes how to install the plugin and get it working.

1. Upload the plugin files to the `/wp-content/plugins/firepro` directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.
1. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' screen in WordPress

-- API Handling

 + Upon install the plugin generates a unique identifier using wordpress internal keys allowing for CDN access.

Upgraded access is possible via premium pathways.

WP end point /wp-json/firepro/templates
